{"chapters":[{"title":"The question","frames":[{"caption":"Each cell has a cost. Moving only right or down, find the cheapest route from top-left to bottom-right (the route pays every cell it visits, both ends included).","grid":{"v":[["1","3","1"],["1","5","1"],["4","2","1"]],"cls":[["","",""],["","",""],["","",""]]}}]},{"title":"Fill the table","frames":[{"caption":"The start costs its own value, 1.","grid":{"v":[["1","",""],["","",""],["","",""]],"cls":[["cur","empty","empty"],["empty","empty","empty"],["empty","empty","empty"]]},"formula":"dp[0][0] = 1"},{"caption":"Cell (0, 1) costs 3. Arrive from the cheaper neighbour: the left (1).","grid":{"v":[["1","4",""],["","",""],["","",""]],"cls":[["src","cur","empty"],["empty","empty","empty"],["empty","empty","empty"]]},"formula":"dp[0][1] = 3 + min(1) = 4","arrows":[[0,0,0,1]]},{"caption":"Cell (0, 2) costs 1. Arrive from the cheaper neighbour: the left (4).","grid":{"v":[["1","4","5"],["","",""],["","",""]],"cls":[["base","src","cur"],["empty","empty","empty"],["empty","empty","empty"]]},"formula":"dp[0][2] = 1 + min(4) = 5","arrows":[[0,1,0,2]]},{"caption":"Cell (1, 0) costs 1. Arrive from the cheaper neighbour: above (1).","grid":{"v":[["1","4","5"],["2","",""],["","",""]],"cls":[["src","done","done"],["cur","empty","empty"],["empty","empty","empty"]]},"formula":"dp[1][0] = 1 + min(1) = 2","arrows":[[0,0,1,0]]},{"caption":"Cell (1, 1) costs 5. Arrive from the cheaper neighbour: the left (2).","grid":{"v":[["1","4","5"],["2","7",""],["","",""]],"cls":[["base","src","done"],["src","cur","empty"],["empty","empty","empty"]]},"formula":"dp[1][1] = 5 + min(4, 2) = 7","arrows":[[1,0,1,1]]},{"caption":"Cell (1, 2) costs 1. Arrive from the cheaper neighbour: above (5).","grid":{"v":[["1","4","5"],["2","7","6"],["","",""]],"cls":[["base","done","src"],["done","src","cur"],["empty","empty","empty"]]},"formula":"dp[1][2] = 1 + min(5, 7) = 6","arrows":[[0,2,1,2]]},{"caption":"Cell (2, 0) costs 4. Arrive from the cheaper neighbour: above (2).","grid":{"v":[["1","4","5"],["2","7","6"],["6","",""]],"cls":[["base","done","done"],["src","done","done"],["cur","empty","empty"]]},"formula":"dp[2][0] = 4 + min(2) = 6","arrows":[[1,0,2,0]]},{"caption":"Cell (2, 1) costs 2. Arrive from the cheaper neighbour: the left (6).","grid":{"v":[["1","4","5"],["2","7","6"],["6","8",""]],"cls":[["base","done","done"],["done","src","done"],["src","cur","empty"]]},"formula":"dp[2][1] = 2 + min(7, 6) = 8","arrows":[[2,0,2,1]]},{"caption":"Cell (2, 2) costs 1. Arrive from the cheaper neighbour: above (6).","grid":{"v":[["1","4","5"],["2","7","6"],["6","8","7"]],"cls":[["base","done","done"],["done","done","src"],["done","src","cur"]]},"formula":"dp[2][2] = 1 + min(6, 8) = 7","arrows":[[1,2,2,2]]},{"caption":"Cheapest total <strong>7</strong>. Following the arrows back from the corner gives the route 1 &rarr; 3 &rarr; 1 &rarr; 1 &rarr; 1.","grid":{"v":[["1","4","5"],["2","7","6"],["6","8","7"]],"cls":[["chosen","chosen","chosen"],["done","done","chosen"],["done","done","chosen"]]},"formula":"answer = 7","path":[[0,0],[0,1],[0,2],[1,2],[2,2]]}]}]}